# GRID results with the AV-HuBERT encoder fine-tuned before feature extraction.
# Frozen-encoder results are in RESULTS. Test: unseen speakers s1 s2 s20 s22.
# Self-decode rows use 3,985 clips (23,910 words), chain rows all 4,000 (24,000
# words), best LM setting on test. All Kaldi rows: flat-start e2e
# chain, renorm + no-relu + CMVN, unless marked fMLLR/tri3b.

# ---- 2026-10-05/06: matched CTC recipe (run_ctc_finetune.sh) ----
# letter CTC head, 3k-update head-only phase, mean-face 96px ROIs + random 88 crop,
# held-out validation speakers s7 s30, frozen BatchNorm stats. LoRA on q/k/v/out/fc1/fc2.

# base, LoRA rank 32 (5.3M trainable), input/avhubert_base_ctc_lora.pt  [headline base]
%WER 6.77 [ 1618 / 23910, 21 ins, 57 del, 1540 sub ] finetune_lora/exp_base_ctc_lora/hyp_test.txt  # model decoding itself, greedy CTC, no grammar
%WER 6.34 [ 1521 / 24000, 0 ins, 0 del, 1521 sub ] exp/chain/e2e_tdnnf_lor10norelu_cmvn/decode_r_test/wer_10_0.0  # layer 10 features, all 4,000 test clips

# base, full fine-tune control (103M trainable), input/avhubert_base_ctc_full.pt
%WER 6.24 [ 1493 / 23910, 17 ins, 65 del, 1411 sub ] finetune_lora/exp_base_ctc_full/hyp_test.txt  # model decoding itself
%WER 5.70 [ 1368 / 24000, 0 ins, 0 del, 1368 sub ] exp/chain/e2e_tdnnf_ful10norelu_cmvn/decode_r_test/wer_10_0.0  # layer 10 features, all 4,000 test clips

# large, LoRA rank 32 (14.2M trainable), input/avhubert_large_ctc_lora.pt  [headline large]
%WER 5.50 [ 1314 / 23910, 17 ins, 24 del, 1273 sub ] finetune_lora/exp_large_ctc_lora/hyp_test.txt  # model decoding itself
%WER 5.55 [ 1333 / 24000, 0 ins, 0 del, 1333 sub ] exp/chain/e2e_tdnnf_lgl20norelu_cmvn/decode_r_test/wer_10_0.0  # layer 20, all 4,000 test clips

# large, full fine-tune control (325.2M trainable), input/avhubert_large_ctc_full.pt
%WER 6.62 [ 1583 / 23910, 9 ins, 26 del, 1548 sub ] finetune_lora/exp_large_ctc_full/hyp_test.txt  # model decoding itself
%WER 6.25 [ 1499 / 24000, 0 ins, 0 del, 1499 sub ] exp/chain/e2e_tdnnf_lgf20norelu_cmvn/decode_r_test/wer_10_0.0  # layer 20, all 4,000 test clips

# ---- 2026-10-16: GRID test, all 4,000 clips (24,000 words) ----
# LM weight chosen on held-out dev speakers, not on GRID test. Base, layer 10
# through the e2e chain (+CMVN), chain seed 0, encoder fine-tune seed 1337.
# arm               seed  valid  GRID
